# Dropbox is the durable store the backup/restore workflows write to / read from.
# One-time setup: create a Dropbox "scoped app" (App folder access) at
# https://www.dropbox.com/developers/apps, enable files.content.write +
# files.content.read + files.metadata.read, then get a refresh token via the
# OAuth offline flow. Put the same 3 values in GitHub repo secrets and Vercel env.
